# Paths whose pull requests the merge queue lands alone, one batch each
# (infra tools/merge-queue, MQ_SOLO_PATHS_FILE; read from main). One glob per
# line, `*` within one path component.
#
# A migration takes the next free number at its own merge, and two in one
# batch could collide; a descriptor or proto change regenerates clients every
# other change builds on. The codewire-ci skill keeps one of each in flight.
crates/*/migrations/**
proto/**
crates/*/proto/**
libs/*/proto/**
**/*.proto
